PY. \n\n**LOOK PRETTY**\n\nLOINCLOTH SO LAST SUMMER. GET NEW. ALL OTHER UG JEALOUS. \n\n**MORE DINO**\n\nUG UPDATE THURSDAY. NEW DINO. MAYBE NEW MAP. NEW BUG? UG FIX BUG. UG PROUD.\n\nJOIN TRIBE\u2026 DISCORD.GG/UGVR", "short_description": "HATCH, RAISE, RIDE DINOSAUR. HELP FRIEND TRADE, FIGHT BOSS. FRIEND DIE. NO LAUGH. NOT FUNNY... OKAY MAYBE SMALL LAUGH. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ug-vr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.ug-vr.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Continuum VR Studios", "support_website_url": "http://discord.gg/ugvr", "website_url": "https://www.ug-vr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "28780642861628205"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619404_2367959984036106_9079182555469674108_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZIsG3L7LseMQ7kNvwF9T-g5&_nc_oc=Adof3U2pP96gSCTS3gMtppnVZoViOXYSNw3Mth8tQLzKtqyke_GK2A0y5Qad8P5LmB8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSfDlJrJucoxunKuue2uefBOpkGLn0cv6rq6YlEiXsBtQ&oe=6AF87DE4"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offe